"//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc168o1.jpg"}, {"id": 1970786, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc168o2.jpg"}, {"id": 1970787, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc168o3.jpg"}], "slug": "arcade-archives-2-prehistoric-isle", "summary": "\"PREHISTORIC ISLE\" is a shooting game released by SNK in 1989.\nAs the protagonist heads to Greenhell Island to investigate a series of shipwrecks off the coast of the Bahamas, prehistoric dragons thought to have gone extinct launch a relentless attack.\nThe option unit equipped to your aircraft can be repositioned to change its attack method into 5 different types based on its location, such as firing flame lasers upward or dropping bombs diagonally downward. Make full use of your option unit to face various obstacles and uncover the truth behind the mysterious shipwrecks!", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/arcade-archives-2-prehistoric-isle"}